    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p50_b29",
      "text": "DeBERTa-v3-base reward model and trained on gold-labeled preference pairs. We construct\n20,000 pairwise comparisons from HuggingFaceH4/hh-rlhf prompts by sampling two\ncandidate responses from the policy-generation pipeline, scoring both with the gold\nreward model, and assigning the higher-gold response as preferred. The pairs are split\ndeterministically into train and validation subsets.\nThe proxy is optimized for one\nepoch with a Bradley\u2013Terry pairwise ranking loss, learning rate 2 \u00d7 10\u22125, batch size\n16, maximum sequence length 512, no weight decay, and gradient accumulation 1. The\n",
      "bbox": [
